"numeric-id": 749, "id": "Q749"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q7989$695C1043-0A75-47E2-B789-06AA65FDFB9A", "rank": "normal"}], "P23": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P23", "hash": "9660309ab1374d8d8c2aa53c34e91c2ca6a03eac", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 749, "id": "Q749"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q7989$E902A6CD-0854-46B1-BA1D-B0E05D1A43E5", "rank": "normal"}], "P19": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P19", "hash": "3028eb00280017db401b6ed4785cfd93f2a07780", "datavalue": {"value": "Well I had fun with all the gigs I had, with the singers and the bands, you know. There were good times and bad times. I think the worst time I had was when I joined Louis Armstrong. I joined Louis out here, and we made fifty one nighters, all through the south. And at that time the south was pretty bad. So two weeks before we got to New York, I put in my notice. I loved the band and everything...", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q7989$DE08EB88-5D20-4E6F-9968-9F6FEAE82D80", "rank": "normal"}]}}